<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank goodness! Really, thank goodness! I thought you'd never wake up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\五島春花驚き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Is this... a hospital room...?
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\永劫回帰\病室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\五島春花普通.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE>I see... I came back, then. To this world."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島泣き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, thank goodness...! If even </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> disappeared, Niimura-senpai, I...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi's</STYLE> dead, then..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\五島春花普通.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"I killed her. That's a fact, no mistake about it. 
{PAUSE ""}
I have to face it."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島泣き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">... Please don't carry it all alone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, there has to be some outside factor behind what you did!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I've gathered so much information this past year!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If I can prove it, then an acquittal―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, that's not it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島驚き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
"More than whether I'm innocent... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, I've got a favor to ask. I found out how to solve the case. 
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\五島春花目閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
There's a poor <STYLE ID="4">girl</STYLE> living on Mount Itohime in Arata. 
{PAUSE ""}
Someone who's been used by a bad one for 800 years, all alone. 
{PAUSE ""}
Please, get <STYLE ID="4">her</STYLE> out of there. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sure they won't let me out of here for a while, so <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> go in my place... 
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\五島春花目横.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Then everything will be settled."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島驚き横目.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島真剣.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Understood! Leave it to the genius girl Erina Goto!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uuu...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\春花五島泣き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Aaaaaah! </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1"> woke uuup!!!!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">　Aaaaah!!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\五島春花驚き目横.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Do you know how hard it's been since then!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> came every single day to check on </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> and cried!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I searched everywhere for a way to bring </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> back too!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">　Stupid, stupid, stupid! </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you big idiooot!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\病室\五島春花目横笑顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―I left that world, and woke.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "111.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院外風景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Later, through </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> efforts, the existence of </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> came to light.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was cut away from </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and is apparently being protected somewhere.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kept secret, no less, at the level of a state secret.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Because if </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s existence became known, people with bad ideas would come from all over the world, after that miracle they call agelessness and immortality.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Then a few years passed―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\春花寝ころび1.lcm" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">and at last, an ordinary life came back to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In the end, what I did was never judged by the law.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Since then, when cherry blossom season comes, I've taken to gazing at the sky alone like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Nothing special: a spring landscape and cherry blossoms you can see anywhere.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I just gaze at the drifting clouds like this, and feel the flow of the wind and of time.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sometimes I think: what if I had escaped into that other world?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That might have been a happy life in its own way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\春花寝ころび3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\春花寝ころび3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">even so, I don't regret it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\春花寝ころび4.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Because this is where I belong.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\春花寝ころび5.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\春花寝ころび6.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島見おろし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>... What's up?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, I just wanted to see </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">, Senpai... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I figured you'd probably be here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Aren't you hot, dressed like that?
{PAUSE ""}
　They said it'll get pretty warm today."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島見おろし困り.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, just as you say. Operation failed... It's April already, after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島見おろし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So, what were you looking at?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Clouds."<PG>
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島見おろし口開け.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Clouds?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Why do clouds float, I wonder?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\永劫回帰\雲.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n20000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
"There are all sorts of strange things in this world, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　Unknown phenomena, things science can't explain. 
{PAUSE ""}
If those didn't exist, what kind of world would it have been?"<PG>
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n123\r\n000\r\n11\r\n150\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
"Because strange things exist... 
{PAUSE ""}
that's how humans came to have hearts, maybe. 
{PAUSE ""}
Clouds float, so it's strange. 
{PAUSE ""}
The wind blows, so it's strange. 
{PAUSE ""}
That I have a self like this and feel that things are strange, that's strange. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, you being here beside me like this... that's strange too..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's because I want to be with </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">, Niimura-senpai. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Because I have a heart that feels that way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, because you have a heart that makes me want to be with you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
That's right. If you're not with someone, you don't feel that things are strange. 
{PAUSE ""}
Just looking alone at what's in front of you, you'd never get a heart that way."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\肉付き\病院外風景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島横1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, are you glad you came back to this world?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島横口閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"You told me a little, before, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　That if you'd never woken up, and could have escaped into a world where </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is alive..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島横下向き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"I think that would have been fine too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even if it meant </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> never woke up, Niimura-senpai, if </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> were happy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Happy, huh... 
{PAUSE ""}
But I thought, if I hadn't come back, I'd have made <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> sad, Goto, and <STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE> too. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I came back."<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島横驚き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"For our sake...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Besides, whatever the cause was, what I did doesn't change. 
{PAUSE ""}
Running from that, what would that make me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島横下向き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't mean to deny who </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> are now, Senpai, but I don't think running away is dishonorable. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島横口閉じ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">but still, if I'm allowed to be selfish, I wanted you to come back."</STYLE><PG>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
Then I have to accept what I did. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">My mom's</STYLE> really amazing, you know. She loved <STYLE ID="8">Dad</STYLE> so much, and he died so suddenly... 
{PAUSE ""}
And she got over even that, and she's doing fine, like you see. 
{PAUSE ""}
I really feel that I'm living surrounded by amazing people. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>... when even now, accepting what happened to her is still so hard..."<PG>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島横1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is doing fine because </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">'re here, Senpai. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Your mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the amazing person she is thanks to none other than </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">, Niimura-senpai."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... It's okay for me to be here, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\永劫回帰\未来\五島横笑顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, thank you. I'm glad I came back after all."<PG>
